", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-06", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761732, "segment_id": "vG5EUD5tBT", "segment_broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "segment_title": "Stock Market Report (Studio: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63200.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761734, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-06", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761732, "segment_id": "YM16P4pQ8B", "segment_broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "segment_title": "Decision 2004 / Bush vs. Kerry / Energy", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Report introduced. \n (New York: David Gregory) The differing ideas of President Bush & Senator John Kerry on an energy policy compared. [KERRY \u2013 says no young American in uniform should be held hostage to America\u2019s dependence on oil in the Middle East.] [Tuesday, Vice President Dick CHENEY \u2013 criticizes Kerry & Senator John Edwards for voting against more oil drilling in Alaska.] [International economics analyst C. Fred BERGSTEN&#134;- notes the necessity of importing oil.]", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63230.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761736, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-06", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761732, "segment_id": "K5QhNvADgg", "segment_broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "segment_title": "Terrorism / Al Qaeda Threat", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Report introduced.   (Washington: Pete Williams) The continuing investigation of the evidence indicating an Al Qaeda terror plot against financial institutions in the US featured; details given of the role of captured Al Qaeda suspect Issa al-Hindi, of charges in Britain against Babar Ahmad for raising money for terrorists and his possession of classified information about the US Navy. [Terrorism expert David AARON&#134;- comments on the impact of Hindi\u2019s arrest on other plotters.] [Federal prosecutor Kevin O\u2019CONNOR&#134;- comments on Ahmad\u2019s Websites.] New interest in captured Al Qaeda suspect Mohammed Babar&#134;&#134;, who provided information that led to terror arrests in Britain, noted. [Earlier, BABAR \u2013 threatens to kill every American he sees.]", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63360.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761737, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-06", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761732, "segment_id": "D5jA5sAZ3U", "segment_broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "segment_title": "Defending America: How Safe? How Soon? (Part V)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Secretary of Defense Donald Rumsfeld\u2019s pledge of support for the 9/11 Commission\u2019s recommendation for the creation of an intelligence czar noted.   (Washington: Lisa Myers) Worrisome evidence that the 9/11 hijackers had help from people inside the US who knew of the terrorists\u2019 intentions examined; details given about 3 men who crossed paths with hijackers Nawaf al-Hazmi\u2020\u2020 & Khalid al-Mihdhar\u2020\u2020 after they arrived in the US: Yemeni Modhar Abdullah\u2020, Saudi diplomat Fahad al-Thumairy\u2020 & San Diego Imam Anwar Aulaqi\u2020. [9/11 Commission Timothy ROEMER\u2020- says the plotters had help; states there are clues that are not answered.] [In telephone interview from Yemen, ABDULLAH \u2013 denies helping the hijackers.]", "segment_duration": 200, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63500.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761738, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-06", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761732, "segment_id": "NRXVnAcBUt", "segment_broadcast_id": "bPz7g4GPlx", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63700.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761739, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contribut